          <div style="font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(12px,1.7vw,18px);color:var(--tm);line-height:1.6">NEXUS tells AI agents <span style="color:var(--vb);font-weight:700">what</span> you're building.</div>
          <div style="font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(12px,1.7vw,18px);color:var(--tm);line-height:1.6;margin-top:4px">But how does it know <span style="color:var(--cb);font-weight:700">how</span> you build?</div>
