        <div class="s-hl" style="font-size:clamp(16px,2.8vw,36px)">The future of development is <span style="color:var(--vb);animation:glowText 2s ease-in-out infinite">AI-native.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div id="s6l" style="display:flex;gap:10px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .7s;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center">
