        <div style="font-family:'Orbitron',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(11px,1.6vw,18px);color:var(--cb);font-weight:700;font-style:italic;animation:glowText 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;line-height:1.7">they understand why."</div>
